cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills in your work, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "shuji: skills for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  Portable skills for coding agents in the Agent Skills format: bento-diagrams draws engineering diagrams in Apple's
  system look as one draw.io file for both themes, checked for overlaps; sumi-diagrams writes Mermaid diagrams and
  charts rendered by Pele as one themeable SVG, checked for syntax, overlaps and size, and diagrams of a change for
  pull requests.
authors:
